hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"93","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ishaq bin Mansoor, qala: haddasana Abdullah bin Numair, qala: haddasana Ubaidullah bin Umar, an Nafi', an Ibn Umar, qala: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne chandi ki angoothi banwai, jo unke haath mein rahi, phir Abu Bakr aur Umar ke haath mein rahi, phir Uthman ke haath mein rahi, yahan tak ke woh Beer Arees mein gir gayi. Us ka naqsh tha: Muhammad Rasoolullah."
"94","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Sahl bin Askar Al-Baghdadi, aur Abdullah bin Abdur Rehman, qala: akhbarana Yahya bin Hassan, qala: haddasana Sulaiman bin Bilal, an Shareek bin Abdullah bin Abi Namir, an Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Hunein, an abihi, an Ali bin Abi Talib: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni angoothi dahein haath mein pehente the. Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, qala: haddasana Ahmad bin Salih, qala: haddasana Abdullah bin Wahb, an Sulaiman bin Bilal, an Shareek bin Abdullah bin Abi Namir, isi jaisa."
"95","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Sahl bin Askar Al-Baghdadi, aur Abdullah bin Abdur Rehman, qala: akhbarana Yahya bin Hassan, qala: haddasana Sulaiman bin Bilal, an Shareek bin Abdullah bin Abi Namir, an Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Hunein, an abihi, an Ali bin Abi Talib: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam apni angoothi dahein haath mein pehente the. Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, qala: haddasana Ahmad bin Salih, qala: haddasana Abdullah bin Wahb, an Sulaiman bin Bilal, an Shareek bin Abdullah bin Abi Namir, isi jaisa."
"96","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani', qala: haddasana Yazeed bin Haroon, an Hammad bin Salama, qala: maine Ibn Abi Rafi' ko dahein haath mein angoothi pehente hue dekha, to maine unse is ke baare mein poocha. Unhon ne kaha: maine Abdullah bin Jafar ko dahein haath mein angoothi pehente hue dekha aur Abdullah bin Jafar ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam dahein haath mein angoothi pehente the."
"97","[AI-translation] Haddasana Yahya bin Moosa, qala: haddasana Abdullah bin Numair, qala: haddasana Ibrahim bin Al-Fazl, an Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel, an Abdullah bin Jafar, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam dahein haath mein angoothi pehente the."
"98","[AI-translation] Hamein Abu al-Khattab Ziyad bin Yahya ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Abdullah bin Maimun ne hadees bayan ki, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, un ke waalid se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam daaye haath mein angoothi pehante thay."
"99","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Humaid al-Razi ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Jarir ne hadees bayan ki, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, unhone al-Salt bin Abdullah se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Ibn Abbas daaye haath mein angoothi pehante thay, aur mujhe guman hai ke unhone yeh bhi kaha tha: Rasool Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam daaye haath mein angoothi pehante thay."
"100","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Abi Umar ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne hadees bayan ki, Ayyub bin Musa se, unhone Nafi' se, unhone Ibn Umar se riwayat ki: ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne chandi ki angoothi banwayi, aur us ke fas ko hatheli ki taraf rakha, aur us mein 'Muhammad Rasool Allah' naqsh karwaya, aur kisi ko is par naqsh karne se mana farmaya, aur yahi angoothi thi jo Mu'ayqib se Bi'r-e-Aris ke kuen mein gir gayi thi."
"101","[AI-translation] Hamein Qutayba bin Sa'id ne hadees bayan ki, hamein Hatim bin Isma'il ne hadees bayan ki, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, un ke waalid se, unhone kaha: Hasan aur Husain apne baaye haath mein angoothi pehante thay."
